People keep asking about the next version [1],[2]. What is known is
collected here [3], and there is a poll when the next version will be
released [4]. Currently visible development includes a lot of patches
[5], the interface improvements on NAO, and several variants
(Sporkhack, Unnethack, SLASHEM and older ones).

Another question is what the next version "should" be. Many people
miss user interface improvements. See [6] for hacked add-ons, [7] for
a feature request discussion. Crawl is nearly paradise in comparison
[9]. A poll [8] provides an overview of the current state of Nethack
affairs.

Finally, consider what would actually happen if the mythical next
version were released. Would you play it? If yes, have you tried Spork
and Unnethack? If no, why exactly do you want one?


